Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Reach out your hand. Cut through the\Nwind and make a stand. The paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.76,0:00:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,within brings out a map of your own
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.60,0:00:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the right all we saw
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.82,0:00:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,stormy nights All the rough winds\Nand waves coming day after day And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.30,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the values we had were about to\Ncollapse Oh just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here\Nknows it for certain So
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes and breathe\Nin deeply And listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul. You'll see a\Npath in front of you. And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll know just where you\Nneed to go So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And make us stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way, that's what's\Nbest for me. And you do it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's got to\Nbe. We're moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm ready But at times\Nit's okay to get help on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.86,0:01:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the way For the future ahead\Nburning bright For what's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.96,0:01:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahead you see is beyond your\Nwildest dreams, so stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.42,0:01:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,up tall reach out your\Nhand cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and make a stand don't\Nlet the darkness win just
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.82,0:01:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,break through we'll do it\Nour way the best that we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,know with tears and doubts\Nand tone we'll go where
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.56,0:01:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We all want to go. The page\Nwithin brings colors of Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.34,0:02:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.46,0:02:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay focused!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.80,0:02:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.46,0:02:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish you this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.08,0:02:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.37,0:02:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just break Master\NQueen's sword with his neck?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.96,0:02:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I saw, but that\Nwould be impossible, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.04,0:02:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Sanji's neck broke\Nthat sword in twain! Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that Haki?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.16,0:02:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of power has he got? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You did that yourself\Nwithout armament Haki?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I get to see\Nsome genotech after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.18,0:02:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's happening again. Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.78,0:03:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Never seen someone with\Na body like yours before,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.16,0:03:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but I do remember Judge going on about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give humans exoskeletons\Nand accelerated healing, he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give them incredible\Nstrength and a heart
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,of ice that won't be\Nswayed by petty emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I deeply apologize, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.68,0:03:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I never should have offered\Na dish so appalling to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.18,0:03:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to leave\Na star on a lady's face?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.86,0:03:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:03:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a human, not a cold-blooded\Ncreature like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.70,0:04:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.00,0:04:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you don't gotta cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.04,0:04:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the monster club.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.00,0:04:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You are gonna fit right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.84,0:04:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Coffee Bean!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.78,0:04:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.24,0:04:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me a sec here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.10,0:04:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta figure out what's\Ngoing on with my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a little time to think, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.48,0:04:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What could have caused this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You really like wasting\Nmy time, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.12,0:04:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it because I transformed into\NSilver Mask? Really, I used the suit a
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,couple of times and i'm losing my humanity
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.54,0:04:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,already something's wrong why is he
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:05:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,running away hey look it's one of the\NStraw Hats i guess he's scared of master
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen, he's talking to himself or\Nsomething. Just shoot. He's asking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.06,0:05:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done for, Blackleg.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.22,0:05:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to eat lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a bullseye. Nailed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.93,0:05:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,His exoskeleton's tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.02,0:05:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me more of your germ attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Put on the suit, be your pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up about germa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I got nothing to do with those maniacs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're probably a spy\Nfor the Navy, but who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sweating the deets right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All that matters to me is whether\Nyou want to take down Kaido or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.92,0:06:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah-ba-ba-ba-ba!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When this fight's over, the loser will be\Ndead and the winner will be busted up bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.04,0:06:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect chance to send them\Non their way, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You dig it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.80,0:06:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,there's room for one more\Nwe can just snatch up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.20,0:06:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The spoils and bounce.\NWe're not loyal to Kaido's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.64,0:06:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,army and we got nothing\Nriding on those samurai
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.98,0:06:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,either so there's no\Nreason for us to fight
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.34,0:06:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,how audacious you really think\Ni'd trust a rotten backstabber
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:06:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,like you no offense but you're\Nnot too trustworthy yourself pal
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but we can both trust each other\Nto act in our self-interest
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to hit it big, this is\Nthe best chance you'll ever have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you laughing at don't\Ntell me you've lost your mind i
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.58,0:07:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,know i've cornered you but try
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.10,0:07:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,to die with some
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.01,0:07:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Dignity, did you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.16,0:07:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,eat a smile fruit perhaps
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,what
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,a picturesque tragedy brilliant
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.62,0:07:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys over there, are you okay, Killer?\NYou guys, what did you do to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.62,0:07:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkins, I can't believe\Nyou sold out to Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.16,0:07:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for betraying us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.24,0:08:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Stop! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lay a finger on him, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.64,0:08:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I forbid it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.62,0:08:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's our enemy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.90,0:08:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't we help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.66,0:08:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you haven't noticed, I've\Ntaken your captain's life hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.82,0:08:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I gather,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.66,0:08:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fighting against Big Mom right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Already a losing battle, one might say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You only have two options, and I'll\Ngladly make the decision for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.76,0:08:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.24,0:08:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We better think of something fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to bail if\Nthe fire gets any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.08,0:08:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,we're back master as you\Ncan see we brought Kumachi
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.44,0:09:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We better hurry. That\Nfire's spreading fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.64,0:09:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ghost! No, a human legman monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.36,0:09:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Poot, someone, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.70,0:09:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody, Poot, anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.10,0:09:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Poot, wait a second, slow down so\NI can catch you. Whoever you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,please help I said, slow down, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.86,0:09:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mind your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You grab the leg of Kitamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.42,0:09:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want my help or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.46,0:09:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's not a ghost after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it human?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.38,0:09:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps a dream? Leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm searching for my allies!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.02,0:09:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I am your ally, Kitamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, your old pal, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Outhand me, you rogue!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.50,0:10:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,For there is no time to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.74,0:10:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't hear us without ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.02,0:10:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know where his head's at.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how do we let him know that it's us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.52,0:10:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Remove your hands from my posterior.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.98,0:10:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.10,0:10:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he talking to us without a mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Farts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's call it a special talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.02,0:10:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Farts?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.18,0:10:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't hear us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I must train in this field myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.52,0:10:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.56,0:10:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I got it! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Reverse Crescent Moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.90,0:10:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You traced that on my posterior!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.80,0:10:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That means you're an ally!\NOoh, yeah! That was easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.82,0:10:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, lend me your assistance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.14,0:10:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One of my companions is in\Na terrible state right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.62,0:11:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come to her aid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We can have Hamlet take us there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later, Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so terribly popular today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Head to the left tower on\Nthe castle's first floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.34,0:11:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My ally is in a crawlspace there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know not who you are,\Nbut you have my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.34,0:11:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Legs, count on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt like hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.26,0:11:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.26,0:11:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.14,0:12:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Having a migraine?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.34,0:12:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What terrible timing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.45,0:12:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.88,0:12:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, Hera! Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.00,0:12:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.64,0:12:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Napoleon! Ready, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.12,0:12:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.54,0:12:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A kiss won't fix it, but your head\Nwon't hurt after I chop it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.98,0:12:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.52,0:12:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how about a thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.54,0:12:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die protecting you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.22,0:12:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop getting in my way, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.60,0:12:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now shamble!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.49,0:12:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And counter-shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you do that to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stolen fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.50,0:13:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.76,0:13:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one of you naughty\Nboys should I chop up first?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.78,0:13:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The quack who keeps getting in my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Or the half-dead, loud-mouthed rascal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've made it to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.74,0:13:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going head-to-head with an emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If I end up dying here,\Nthen what was it for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.26,0:13:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure know how to make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.10,0:13:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.02,0:14:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you gotta get back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.88,0:14:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to kill you, but it\Nseems like you're dying just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.56,0:14:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.94,0:14:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Argus!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.06,0:14:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I think not. Sorry. NO!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is someone doing this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.78,0:14:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.46,0:14:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.52,0:15:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.88,0:15:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go and you can\Nhave my life instead
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You value kid far too much you're\Nbetter off without him you have suffered
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,tremendously But all those misfortunes\Ncan be traced back to your captain
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get it do you\NHawkins you never did
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.98,0:15:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid will surpass the Four Emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna be King of the Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.42,0:15:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stop already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeating the Four Emperors!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Becoming King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What grand ambitions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.16,0:15:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How admirable!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.40,0:15:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why are you getting in our way?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.28,0:16:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In your way, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.84,0:16:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then pick up your blades and kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.62,0:16:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I would accept your surrender, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.74,0:16:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd even put in a good\Nword for you with Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.30,0:16:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're asking me to serve\Nthat bastard after all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm not as pathetic as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.66,0:16:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Imbecile!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.64,0:16:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your battle was doomed from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no hope of beating an emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.96,0:16:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You've seen the beast you're up against!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.72,0:16:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you understand now why\Nthey've ruled the seas for so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your instincts must be telling\Nyou to run for your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.98,0:16:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Any opposition is futile!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.04,0:16:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,don't need to yell about it you can't hide
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.88,0:16:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,your regret you took the coward's way out
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.46,0:17:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,regardless if you bow\Nto me i shall welcome
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.24,0:17:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you as my support in it\Ni get to bowing quick
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you sacrificed your dignity\Nto save your life but we never
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrendered and we're still here.\NThis tale has attempted. You'll
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,see which one of us regrets our\Nchoices all right then sink or
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.76,0:17:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Swim. I'll finish this with no\Nregrets. You'll get what's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't last like this
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.94,0:17:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nighty-night, you? Erica? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:18:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,have two questions for you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen if you\Ntake damage somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.92,0:18:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,that has no conduit who does that affect
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you talking about\Ni've made the nature of my
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,power perfectly clear to you\Nthere's no escape any damage
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,i take goes straight to kid\Nhis straw doll exists inside
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.26,0:18:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,me every inch of his body\Nacts as my personal shield
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible, how did you\Nsuffer my arm, the damn
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.04,0:19:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,it should have gone to\Nshit he's missing an arm
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.16,0:19:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I wasn't prepared for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.10,0:19:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The second question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.26,0:19:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If I take this doll, how many\Nlives are left to protect you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.10,0:19:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you've done well that was the last one
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.50,0:19:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the pain went away i don't understand
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,straw man cards they're\Nupright the card of destruction
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.42,0:20:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Beheading Klaus!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.88,0:20:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.84,0:20:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.78,0:20:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats aren't dead yet.\NThey will return if the cards
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.96,0:20:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,so decree I shall reveal the\Ntrue ending of this battle
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.72,0:20:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The tower
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.22,0:20:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Spin and stun it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.34,0:21:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.80,0:21:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.82,0:21:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.02,0:21:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.58,0:21:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw man card the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.86,0:21:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It has two meetings
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.44,0:21:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,One, The Collapse of the Old.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.24,0:21:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling better?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.86,0:21:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see what I can do about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.74,0:22:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end this. Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.14,0:22:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel light as a feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And the card's hidden\Nmeaning, A New Path Forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.58,0:22:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go get her, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.92,0:22:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiku, they're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.48,0:22:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.62,0:22:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How fortunate that I found\Nan ally. And more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.94,0:22:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How fortunate that I survived\NEven after being chopped in half
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.56,0:22:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps my body was\Nnot reattached properly
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.28,0:23:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,After Sir Law cut it It\Nis truly a miracle Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.26,0:23:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray that my fortune holds\NSo that Kiku may be saved
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.92,0:23:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.83,0:23:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this on? Hello? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.60,0:23:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro, answer me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.06,0:23:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can you hear me? Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.00,0:23:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.91,0:23:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Orochi's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.24,0:23:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I am certain that I thoroughly\Nbeheaded him in our last encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.16,0:23:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems he does not know\Nthat Kanjuro has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.78,0:23:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.56,0:23:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Lord Orochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.30,0:23:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You barely breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.94,0:23:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.44,0:24:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.86,0:24:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear this is the end of my performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.38,0:24:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. I join.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.00,0:24:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.70,0:24:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You've paid your part to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.78,0:24:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.30,0:24:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall carry your kind\Nwords to the next world.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.34,0:24:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet, Contoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.82,0:24:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, the crowd cheers for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.64,0:24:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you hear them?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.06,0:24:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're cheering for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.62,0:24:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.00,0:24:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But my resentment has not faded!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.68,0:24:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.00,0:24:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.26,0:24:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Our ancestors!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.78,0:25:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They're waiting for a spectacular encore!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.62,0:25:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.70,0:25:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,raise your brush and paint it for me,\Nthe Kurozumi Kwan's burning crutch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.34,0:25:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not defeated yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.70,0:25:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The wrath of the Kurozumi\Nclan will come to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.10,0:25:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It will parade from this castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.26,0:25:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I see it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.18,0:25:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Walking deep into the abyss\Nuntil its fury is spent.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.16,0:25:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the place where it finds\Nrest at last will be our premium.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.74,0:25:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Only you can put our tired\Nspirits to rest, Kanjuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.76,0:25:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.58,0:25:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.20,0:26:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my most esteemed audience,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.04,0:26:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I present to you my final\Nperformance, the Kurozumi Clan
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.46,0:26:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Suicide Rapid Finale, Kazenbo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.80,0:26:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! A fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.80,0:26:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He turned into a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.32,0:26:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a report!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.08,0:26:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Some sort of giant apparition has appeared
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.34,0:26:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,on the second floor\Ninside the castle halls!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.28,0:26:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's moving slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.70,0:27:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but it passes through walls like\Na ghost that seems to spread fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.80,0:27:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle is now engulfed in flames!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.06,0:27:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a Germa suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.76,0:27:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.26,0:27:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll shut you up for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.96,0:27:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's far too much fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.40,0:27:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to pull back!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.88,0:28:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't stay here and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.38,0:28:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.64,0:28:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire will cut off our\Nretreat if we don't hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.24,0:28:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki Clan and its allies!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.22,0:28:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Emperor of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.14,0:28:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you should know that\Npride comes before the foal!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.64,0:29:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.64,0:29:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.28,0:29:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Heart!
